      en: ["Principal maritime gateway for the southwestern Atsimo-Andrefana region.", "Located on the Mozambique Channel.", "A key export node for regional sisal, cotton, maize, and cassava.", "Receives essential fuel and manufactured goods for the deep south.", "Shallow waters often require larger ships to load via smaller barges.", "A critical economic driver in a predominantly arid and isolated region."]
