      en: ["Located in the fertile Mahavavy River plain in the Diana region.", "Operated by the national sugar company, SUCOMA.", "The estate encompasses thousands of hectares of sugar cane plantations.", "The on-site mill processes cane into sugar, molasses, and alcohol.", "The harvesting season runs primarily from June to December.", "A massive agro-industrial complex driving the northern economy."]
