      en: ["Established in the 1920s during the French colonial period.", "Located in the town of Dzamandzar on the island of Nosy Be.", "Historically processed local sugar cane into internationally recognized rum.", "Operated by the Société Siramamy Malagasy (SIRAMA).", "Ceased major industrial operations in the early 2000s due to economic issues.", "The massive abandoned factory now serves as a historic industrial monument."]
