      en: ["The historical maritime lifeline for the isolated Anosy region.", "Located on a peninsula in the city of Tôlanaro (Fort-Dauphin).", "Historically handled the export of live lobsters, sisal, and mica.", "Shallow waters required the use of smaller boats (lighters) to load cargo.", "Commercial dominance was replaced by the modern Port d'Ehoala in 2009.", "Currently utilized primarily by the local artisanal fishing fleet."]
