      en: ["A proposed heavy mineral sands mining project near Toliara.", "Aims to extract ilmenite, zircon, and rutile from coastal dunes.", "Represents an estimated $600 million foreign investment.", "Projected to produce over 600,000 tons of ilmenite annually.", "Faces intense opposition from local communities and environmental groups.", "Threatens the local Mikea forest and Vezo indigenous livelihoods."]
